Project: CGAL (Computational Geometry Algorithms Library)
URL: https://github.com/CGAL/cgal
License: GPL-3.0-or-later / LGPL / commercial (see LICENSE*)
Version: 6.2 (library release, header-only)

Upstream: CGAL-6.2-library.zip from GitHub releases (v6.2).

Blender integration notes:
- Vendored under extern/cgal for Geometry Nodes (WITH_CGAL).
- Algorithms are called only from intern/cgal_bridge (never from unity-built node TUs).
- Default kernel: Exact_predicates_inexact_constructions_kernel (EPICK).
- Full EPECK path requires WITH_MPFR + MPFR libraries (optional).
- Do not compile examples/tests/demos.
